==Strategy==
Slowly build up money by stalling the Le'boins as much as possible. Once you have enough, spawn [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] to kill the Le'boins. A little after the initial wave of Le'boins, Owlbrows will start spawning along with another Le'boin. Keep stalling them and send out [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan]] to resist most of the attacks and to directly attack the 2 enemies. Continue this strategy until you win.

For 4 Crown, [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]] can kill a Le'Boin in two hits, using the Squire Rels as a stepping stone. [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], by virtue of being one of the only LD units, works wonders here.

